~ start
Danny: I'm mid-raid, so I'm saying this ONCE. {{move_name}} to move, {{punch_name}} punches, {{dodge_name}} dashes. Land three punches and the third one really hurts.
Danny: TAP {{block_name}} the instant a hit lands and you PARRY it. There's no blocking on this server, so holding it down just gets you smacked. A parry that lands costs nothing, staggers some attacks, and then you get to hit them back. Miss one and it costs you stamina, so don't just spam it.
Danny: That stamina bar under your hearts pays for dashing and for missed parries, and it only refills slowly. A dash takes a third of it and leaves you stuck for a moment after, unless you parry out of it. Run it dry and you can't do either.
Danny: Boss goes all dizzy? Follow the prompt to finish him: mash {{mash_left_name}} and {{mash_right_name}}.
Danny: Need out mid-fight? {{pause_name}} pauses it, and from there you can resume, start the fight over, change these controls or run home to the menu. That's everything, dum dum.
Danny: Now go warm up on that sparring bot: punch it, combo it, finish it. Then WALK INTO THE POST beside it and it starts swinging back - red over its head means TAP {{block_name}} to parry, yellow means {{dodge_name}} straight through it. Those two reads are the whole game. You CAN'T lose in here. Done? Hit I'm ready, or walk out the Arena #1 door. Don't cry to me when the Captain flattens you.
=> END
